---
export const prerender = true;
import AboutHeroImage from '../assets/about-avatar-banner.jpg';
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About Me"
	description="Revisionist, Industrialist & Factual Obsessive."
	pubDate={new Date('February 18 2026')}
	heroImage={AboutHeroImage}
	heroVariant="avatar"
>
	<section class="space-y-4 mb-10">
		<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-foreground">Founder &amp; Projects</h2>
		<p class="text-muted-foreground text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
			Founder of <a href="https://bibleos.ai" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-primary font-medium hover:underline">BibleOS.ai</a>, <a href="https://agentfriendly.network" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-primary font-medium hover:underline">AFN (agentFriendly.network)</a>, and <a href="https://agentuniver.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-primary font-medium hover:underline">agentUniver.com</a>.
		</p>
		<ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground">
			<li>
				<a href="https://bibleos.ai" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-foreground font-semibold hover:text-primary transition-colors">BibleOS.ai</a> — Distributed civilizational evolution protocol and persistent intelligence substrate.
			</li>
			<li>
				<a href="https://agentfriendly.network" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-foreground font-semibold hover:text-primary transition-colors">AFN (agentFriendly.network)</a> — Open interaction and interoperability protocol network for autonomous agents.
			</li>
			<li>
				<a href="https://agentuniver.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-foreground font-semibold hover:text-primary transition-colors">agentUniver.com</a> — Global decentralized autonomous AI Agent marketplace and skill distribution hub.
			</li>
		</ul>
	</section>

	<p>
		I am a <strong>Centrist Revisionist</strong> (Social-Liberal, certified) who occasionally switches to an anarchist mindset when my core values are challenged. I am a staunch advocate for digital freedom, open-source collaboration, environmental sustainability, and the profound elegance found in <strong>silence and asynchronous workflows</strong>. 
	</p>

	<p>
		By profession, I "bake cakes" (build engineering logic and structural protocols) in the <strong>FMT (Finance, Media, Technology)</strong> industry. My current trajectory involves a deep transition between Engineering and Industrial paradigms (E&I transition), always seeking the absolute architecture hidden beneath the surface of complex systems.
	</p>

	<p>
		I describe myself as a <strong>135° Youth</strong>—an angle that represents my refusal to align with traditional polarities. I am a chronic patient of <em>Chunibyo</em> (ちゅうにびょう), finding meaning in the "stream of consciousness" rather than the mundane "West Coast" patterns. I have a severe case of "厭蠢症" (Aversion to stupidity), cured only by the precision of factual analysis and the relentless pursuit of truth.
	</p>

	<blockquote>
		"I'm volatile, self-obsessed, and don't play well with others."
	</blockquote>

	<p>
		As a <strong>Factual Obsessive</strong>, I don't follow the crowd. I don't engage in meaningless debates with the shallow or the closed-minded. If you're looking for an objective perspective or a cold splash of reality, you've found the right place. I believe in passion, heat, and the invariant echoes that connect the underlying protocols of history to the future order.
	</p>

	<ul>
		<li>#Revisionist #SocialLiberal #BareMetal</li>
		<li>#FMT #Factualist #Paranoid</li>
		<li>#EcoFriendly #OpenSource #AsyncLife</li>
	</ul>

	<p>
		I am <span class="text-foreground font-semibold">S'ALL Running Man</span>. In this endless marathon, I deconstruct archives and engineering limits to capture the signals within the noise.
	</p>

	<hr class="my-10 border-border/60" />

	<div class="space-y-8">
		<section class="space-y-4">
			<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-foreground">Executionism &amp; Engineering Delivery</h2>
			<blockquote class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-muted/40 border-l-4 border-primary text-foreground font-medium text-base not-italic">
				"The established goal cannot change: Execute, Identify issues, Refine methods, Keep executing."
			</blockquote>
		</section>

		<section class="space-y-4">
			<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-foreground">Identity & Nickname</h2>
			<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2.5 font-mono text-sm pt-1">
				<span class="text-lg font-bold text-foreground">尹鸿文 / 霄枻 / 尚歌</span>
				<span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-card border border-border text-xs text-primary font-semibold">[ 字 · 霂之 ]</span>
				<span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-card border border-border text-xs text-primary font-semibold">[ 号 · 霈泽 ]</span>
				<span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-card border border-border text-xs text-primary font-semibold">[ ID · Geniux ]</span>
			</div>
		</section>
	</div>
</Layout>
